{"id":"0fcc108fa2ae7636","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization.md","title":"Bimodal Arithmetical Realization","display":"df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization — Bimodal Arithmetical Realization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization","aliases":["89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization"],"display":"df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization — Bimodal Arithmetical Realization","depends_on":["[[89-df-bimodal-formula]]","[[89-df-omega-provability]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization — Bimodal Arithmetical Realization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6d483dd2c6fd176\" href=\"?note=a6d483dd2c6fd176\" title=\"89-df-bimodal-formula\">89-df-bimodal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"995dd9138f5c3e5a\" href=\"?note=995dd9138f5c3e5a\" title=\"89-df-omega-provability\">89-df-omega-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55612987d4585fa4\" href=\"?note=55612987d4585fa4\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation\">89-df-arithmetical-interpretation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>；本条局部的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 仍取原文的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\ne0\">\\(0\\ne0\\)</span>。此记号在本条作用域内遮蔽基础算术文件中另一个矛盾式缩写，不把它改为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=S0\">\\(0=S0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(x)\">\\(\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(x)\\)</span> 分别为固定普通可证性与一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 可证性的对象语言公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\ \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\ \\urcorner\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7f53d84c2164d9c5\" href=\"?note=7f53d84c2164d9c5\" title=\"89-df-godel-numbering\">89-df-godel-numbering</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d088b00b91690ba0\" href=\"?note=d088b00b91690ba0\" title=\"89-df-numeral\">89-df-numeral</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^B_r\">\\(\\tau^B_r\\)</span> 的其余递归子句与原文相同。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bimodal\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^B_r&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n\\tau^B_r(p)&amp;\\coloneqq r(p),\\qquad\\tau^B_r(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n\\tau^B_r(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau^B_r(A),\\qquad\n\\tau^B_r(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\tau^B_r(A)\\land\\tau^B_r(B),\\\\\n\\tau^B_r(\\Box_0A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^B_r(A)\\urcorner}),\\\\\n\\tau^B_r(\\Box_1A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^B_r(A)\\urcorner}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bimodal\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^B_r&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n\\tau^B_r(p)&amp;\\coloneqq r(p),\\qquad\\tau^B_r(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n\\tau^B_r(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau^B_r(A),\\qquad\n\\tau^B_r(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\tau^B_r(A)\\land\\tau^B_r(B),\\\\\n\\tau^B_r(\\Box_0A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^B_r(A)\\urcorner}),\\\\\n\\tau^B_r(\\Box_1A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^B_r(A)\\urcorner}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 15 章 pp.190–193。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>全部六个构造分支在 Assertion 中显式覆盖，有限语法树递归唯一确定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^B_r\">\\(\\tau^B_r\\)</span> 并保持闭句。嵌套盒重新编码已经翻译的整句。</p>\n<p>第二盒表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 一致性的对偶，即一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则意义的可证性；不是完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 闭包。本条从双模态句法定义翻译，不把 GLB 定理集作为构造翻译函数所需的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-bimodal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a6d483dd2c6fd176","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-omega-provability","status":"resolved","id":"995dd9138f5c3e5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAn